# Cloudflare Pages redirects — one rule per line:  FROM  TO  [STATUS]
#
# A MIGRATED site lists its old URLs here so existing bookmarks, emailed links and
# indexed search results keep working after the move to Ferst. These are real HTTP
# 301s at the edge (Cloudflare Pages), NOT page code — this file is your site's data,
# edit it freely. A brand-new site needs none of these; leave the examples commented.
#
# This is the standard home for legacy redirects (never astro.config.mjs), which keeps
# the build config identical across every client. See docs/UPDATING.md → "Legacy URLs".
#
# Examples (uncomment + adapt to your old URLs):
#   /old-news/            /posts/                     301
#   /newsletter/          /posts/tag/newsletter/      301
#   /volunteer/           /about/get-involved/        301
#
# Splats/placeholders are supported, e.g.:
#   /blog/*               /posts/:splat               301
#
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
